docs/revision/roster/astra-pro-paper-d10-ext2.md:52:| **11. Cross-references and small wording errors** | **Resolved** | The reset references point to Section 9; Run A uses “runner-up minus R3” (p. 11); audit rates are stated numerically (p. 15). | Accurate. The conclusion ends on p. 19; Availability and Appendix A begin on p. 20. |
