docs/revision/roster/astra-pro-paper-d10-ext2.md:63:- The newest-identity statistic has been extracted from existing diagnostics and reported with its denominator (p. 16).
docs/revision/roster/astra-pro-paper-d10-ext2.md:66:The separation of registered calibration from exploratory intervals is also improved. The remaining issue is the blanket statement that all follow-up intervals condition on fixed markets. **My own suggested replacement last round used that wording too broadly. The author followed that recommendation; the correction below also corrects my recommendation.**
